  {
   "id": 0,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}Hey, {ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00},{01 00 00 05 00} it's cool\nthat you're into sweets\nand all.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 0b 00}But you brush before bed,\nright?\n\n{07 00 00}You're the one who's gonna \nbe cryin' if you get a \ncavity, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 15 00}Uhhh, {ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}?{01 00 00 05 00}\nDid you{01 00 00 05 00} say something{01 00 00 05 00}\njust now.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}?{09 09 00}",
