   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 05 00}What's your problem?!{01 00 00 14 00}\n{ff 00 00 06}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}, why do you\ntreat me like a kid?!\n{07 06 00}For cryin' out loud! Of \ncourse I brush my teeth,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}Really? You do?{01 00 00 0f 00}\nFine then. Forget it,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 04 00}So why does{07 00 00} toothpaste\nalways gotta be so \nmouth-blastingly fresh?\n{07 14 00}You'd think they'd come up\nwith some new flavors,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 16 00}Hey,{01 00 00 0f 00} {ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 13 00}Imagine brushing with \nfrosting and rinsing with\n{04 11 00}, mmm...{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 1b 00}That might be tasty,\n{ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}, but food\nis not for playing with!",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 00 00}Huh?{01 00 00 14 00} Oh yeah, I was just\nasking if you can tie \n'em yourself{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 15 00}What did you say before\nthat?{01 00 00 05 00}{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 0b 00}You know{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{01 00 00 14 00}\n{07 0e 00}Your shoes{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} Can you tie \n'em yourself?{01 00 00 05 00}{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 15 00}No, before that!{01 00 00 05 00}{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 0e 00}Ummm{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{07 00 00}I think I said, \n\"Hey, old man!{01 00 00 05 00} Can you even\ntie your own shoes?\"{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 01 00}You said WHAT?! {01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 02 00}Oh, no! I was just{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\nuhh.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}kidding. Ha ha.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} Ha.\nFunny, right?{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "en": "{ff 00 00 06}{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 05 00}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}! Who are you \ncalling an old man?\n\nYou're the one that naps\nall day like a snoozy old \ngeezer, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\n{09 02 00}{07 00 00}{09 01 00}{07 15 00}And I'm still young,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}! You hear that?\n\nAnd, you moron, I'm not \neven wearing any shoes\nin the first place!\n{07 00 00}I know you're a sleepy guy \nand asking you to think\nis a bit of a stretch{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 15 00}But do yourself a favor and\nthink before you make a \nfool out of yourself!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 0a 00}Yeah, yeah{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}. I heard ya,{01 00 00 05 00}\nold man! {01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}",
   "et": ""
